  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Burrak</defName>
    <label>burrak</label>
    <description>A bear-sized wallower that digs catch-basins that outlive it — abandoned burrak digs are how new micro-oases start. A working oasis tolerates its one huge elder, worn claw-combs and all, the way a town tolerates its engineer; in fiction the biggest of them earns the name burradar, but it is the same animal grown vast, not a second kind.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>1.8</MoveSpeed>
      <MarketValue>260</MarketValue>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-10</ComfyTemperatureMin>
